56,"label":"1956"},"elevation":17,"officialArea":226.909566,"website":"http://www.ci.fremont.ca.us","mayor":"Lily Mei"},"summary":{"extract":"Fremont is a city in Alameda County, California, United States. Located in the East Bay region of the Bay Area, Fremont has a population of 230,504 as of 2020, making it the fourth most populous city in the Bay Area, behind San Jose, San Francisco, and Oakland. It is the closest East Bay city to the high-tech Silicon Valley network of businesses, and has a strong tech industry presence. The city's largest employer is a Tesla manufacturing plant, employing 25,000 people as of 2024.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Mission_Peak_over_Lake_Elizabeth%2C_in_Fremont%2C_California_%28cropped%29.JPG/330px-Mission_Peak_over_Lake_Elizabeth%2C_in_Fremont%2C_California_%28cropped%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fremont%2C_California"},"twins":["Q66485","Q746968","Q734532","Q990385","Q1725"],"climate":{"temp":[9.7,10.6,12.1,13.3,15.9,19,21,21.2,20.8,17.7,13.1,9.8],"rain":[88,91,77,41,14,4,0,1,3,25,53,114],"cloud":[54,50,48,41,29,16,12,12,14,26,41,54]},"land":true}